{"canonical_line_id": "cl_f989550e5b06", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00005", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-5"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-5"], "text": "売上高については百三十六億七千九百万となり、旧前年同期比五点四パーセントの減収となりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1784135119.3865516, "updated_at": 1784135119.3865519, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_1e68510ea20f", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00006", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-6", "stable-7"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-6", "stable-7"], "text": "これは既存円の在籍率向上や工程価格の上昇による補助金増額、保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し主力の保育サービスにおいて増収となりました、不動産事業は前期に計上した大型不動産売却案件の反動により当期も不動産売却は実施したものの全体としては厳粛となりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1784135119.386613, "updated_at": 1784135119.3866131, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_d56d4999b23a", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00007", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-8"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-8"], "text": "なお、その他サービスは概ね計画どおり進捗しております。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1784135119.3866751, "updated_at": 1784135119.3866751, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_a6f9447135c1", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00008", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-9"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-9"], "text": "営業利益は10億6千百万円となり、前年同期比1。5の減益となりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1784135119.3867338, "updated_at": 1784135119.386734, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_c0b4b8815b07", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00009", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-10", "stable-11"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-10", "stable-11"], "text": "不採算事業の撤退や中核事業の合理化、業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七に向上経常利益は11億2800万円となり前年同期比9。5の増益となりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1784135119.3867915, "updated_at": 1784135119.3867917, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_871bb1faf6fe", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00010", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-12"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-12"], "text": "保育所の新規開設や蔵書の実施によりこれらに伴う開園前の補助金収入が加算されたことにより増益となります。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1784135119.3868506, "updated_at": 1784135119.3868508, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_df6afdc9fcf3", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00011", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-13", "stable-14", "stable-15", "stable-16"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-13", "stable-14", "stable-15", "stable-16"], "text": "親会社株主に属する当期純利益率前期に計上した採算事業の撤退に伴う特別損失がなくなったため、同期は増益となりました。続いて進捗についてお知らせいたします。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1784135119.3869085, "updated_at": 1784135119.3869088, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_a309434454cd", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00012", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-17"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-17"], "text": "売上高は通期予算各サービス等も堅調に成長しており当四半期累計期間において順調に推移しております営業利益は通期予算に対し対応のない成果や不採算事業の定義といった毎期継続している費用削減の施策が確実に低下を収益が概ね予算通りに推移する中、これらの施策が利益の上振れをけん引し", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1784135119.386968, "updated_at": 1784135119.3869681, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
