{"canonical_line_id": "cl_fa994047668c", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00014", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-20"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-20"], "text": "資産の後は販売に伴う販売用不動産の減少があった一方で補助金収入による未収入金の増加、不動産取得、保育施設の新設、増証による資産合計は28億7100万円増加しまた。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1784135119.3870847, "updated_at": 1784135119.387085, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
